CVSS 4.0 score table (crates/focus-ops/src/cvss4_table.rs)
--------------------------------------------------------

The score of each CVSS 4.0 macro vector comes from the file cvss_lookup.js of
https://github.com/FIRSTdotorg/cvss-v4-calculator, fetched on 2026-11-12. License:
BSD 2-Clause "Simplified", Copyright (c) 2023 FIRST.ORG, Inc., Red Hat, and
contributors. The text, copied from the LICENSE file of that repository, is in
crates/focus-ops/src/LICENSE-cvss4.txt, next to the table. The score computation in
crates/focus-ops/src/cvss.rs follows the reference calculator (cvss_score.js of the same
repository) and the FIRST CVSS 3.1 and 4.0 specifications; its unit tests use the
official example vectors published by first.org.

CWE catalog (crates/focus-ops/data/cwe.tsv)
-----------------------------------------

The identifier and the name of each weakness of view 1000 (Research Concepts) of the
Common Weakness Enumeration come from the file 1000.csv of
https://cwe.mitre.org/data/csv/1000.csv.zip, fetched on 2026-11-12 (956 entries). Copyright
(c) 2006-2026, The MITRE Corporation. CWE and the CWE logo are trademarks of The MITRE
Corporation. License: the CWE Terms of Use (https://cwe.mitre.org/about/termsofuse.html),
which allow use for research, development and commercial purposes on the condition that
the copyright designation and the license are reproduced in any copy. Both are in
crates/focus-ops/data/CWE-LICENSE.txt, next to the table. The short names that the finding
sheet searches (`xss`, `sqli`, `ssrf`...) are written by Focus.
